\## 27. Final product principle\
\
The Superadmin is the control center for the SaaS company.\
\
It must answer four questions:\
\
1\. \*\*Growth:\*\* Is KigaliFleet acquiring and retaining businesses?\
2\. \*\*Money:\*\* Is the platform collecting subscription revenue correctly?\
3\. \*\*Operations:\*\* Are companies and users able to use the platform successfully?\
4\. \*\*Security:\*\* Is the platform protected and properly governed?\
\
The Superadmin should give the platform owner visibility and control without creating unnecessary access to private company data.\
\
The quality of the Superadmin will determine how effectively KigaliFleet can grow from a small platform into a multi-company SaaS business.\

